designer_notes = "PLACEHOLDER (PROGRESS 110, 2026-11-18, Luke: \"map everything to placeholder abilities and I'll try them in action\"): a motion lab move (game/regents/motion/) on a placeholder built from existing atoms, to try as a prototype. Its name, numbers and what it really does are Luke's. Sword, plain grip, an ult: SHOWN as a cut on up to three foes from a new side each (waltz_cut.tres); THE BODY DOES NOT MOVE: the server's hit is one wide sweep in front. A real waltz (the server placing you at each foe, untouchable) is a new kind (ABILITY_LIMITS.md section 2)."
